r w-fit\"><a class=\"font-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#0A2540] border-b border-[#0A2540]/20 pb-1 group-hover:border-[#0A2540] transition-colors\" href=\"/equipos\">Explorar Catálogo Maestro</a><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[#0A2540] group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform duration-500 text-sm\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&#x27;FILL&#x27; 0, &#x27;wght&#x27; 300, &#x27;GRAD&#x27; 0, &#x27;opsz&#x27; 24\">arrow_forward</span></div><div class=\"mt-24 pt-12 border-t border-[#0A2540]/10\"><p class=\"font-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#0A2540]/40\">LIMA · PERÚ — desde 2021</p></div></div><div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-4 relative h-full mt-8 md:mt-0\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#0A2540] -z-10 translate-x-12 translate-y-12\"></div><div class=\"relative w-full h-[50dvh] md:h-[70vh] lg:h-[85vh] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Equipo láser dental de alta precisión — Endovita Technology\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover scale-110 translate-x-8 md:translate-x-12\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fhome-hero-product.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fhome-hero-product.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fhome-hero-product.webp&amp;w=768&amp;q=75 768w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fhome-hero-product.webp&amp;w=1024&amp;q=75 1024w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fhome-hero-product.webp&amp;w=1280&amp;q=75 1280w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fhome-hero-product.webp&amp;w=1536&amp;q=75 1536w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fhome-hero-product.webp&amp;w=1536&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><div class=\"col-span-1 hidden md:flex justify-center items-center\"><span class=\"text-vertical font-label text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.5em] text-[#0A2540]/30 whitespace-nowrap\">LASERTECH DISTRIBUIDOR AUTORIZADO — 2024</span></div></section><section class=\"w-full px-6 md:px-12 mb-32\"><div class=\"hairline-t pt-20 flex justify-center text-center\"><h2 class=\"font-display italic text-3xl md:text-4xl max-w-[42rem] leading-snug text-[#0A2540]/80\">“No vendemos catálogos. Asesoramos inversiones de seis cifras a odontólogos desde 2021.”</h2></div></section><section class=\"grid grid-cols-12 gap-0 px-6 md:px-12 mb-40\"><div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-5 md:pr-12 order-2 md:order-1 mt-16 md:mt-0\"><div class=\"md:sticky md:top-40\"><span class=\"font-display text-7xl font-light italic text-[#D4A574]/20 block mb-4\">01</span><h3 class=\"font-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-12 text-[#0A2540]\">Índice de Tecnologías</h3><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><a class=\"group flex justify-between items-end py-8 hairline hover:bg-[#F8F5F0]/50 transition-colors px-4 -mx-4 cursor-pointer\" href=\"/equipos/precision-3w\"><div><h4 class=\"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl group-hover:italic transition-all text-[#0A2540]\">Precision 3W</h4><p class=\"font-label text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#0A2540]/40 mt-2\">Soft Tissue Management</p></div><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[#D4A574] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">add</span></a><a class=\"group flex justify-between items-end py-8 hairline hover:bg-[#F8F5F0]/50 transition-colors px-4 -mx-4 cursor-pointer\" href=\"/equipos/simpler-980\"><div><h4 class=\"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl group-hover:italic transition-all text-[#0A2540]\">SIMPLER 980</h4><p class=\"font-label text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#0A2540]/40 mt-2\">Soft Tissue Management</p></div><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[#D4A574] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">add</span></a><a class=\"group flex justify-between items-end py-8 hairline hover:bg-[#F8F5F0]/50 transition-colors px-4 -mx-4 cursor-pointer\" href=\"/equipos/dual-pro\"><div><h4 class=\"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl group-hover:italic transition-all text-[#0A2540]\">Dual Pro</h4><p class=\"font-label text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#0A2540]/40 mt-2\">Soft Tissue Management</p></div><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[#D4A574] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">add</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-7 md:pl-12 md:border-l border-[#0A2540]/5 order-1 md:order-2 mb-10 md:mb-0\"><div class=\"aspect-[4/5] bg-[#F8F5F0] relative overflow-hidden mb-8\"><img alt=\"Control panel de equipo láser dental Endovita\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover mix-blend-multiply opacity-80\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 58vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fcontrol-panel.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fcontrol-panel.webp&amp;w=768&amp;q=75 768w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fcontrol-panel.webp&amp;w=1024&amp;q=75 1024w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fcontrol-panel.webp&amp;w=1280&amp;q=75 1280w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fcontrol-panel.webp&amp;w=1536&amp;q=75 1536w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fcontrol-panel.webp&amp;w=1536&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute bottom-8 md:bottom-12 left-6 md:left-12\"><p class=\"font-body text-sm max-w-sm text-[#0A2540]/60 italic leading-relaxed\">Nuestra fibra de cuarzo de alta fidelidad garantiza una entrega de energía constante, minimizando el daño térmico colateral en intervenciones de tejidos blandos.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 mb-40\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 gap-0 items-start mb-20\"><div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-4\"><span class=\"font-display text-7xl font-light italic text-[#D4A574]/20 block mb-4\">02</span><h3 class=\"font-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#0A2540]\">Cómo Trabajamos</h3></div><div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-20 gap-y-16 md:gap-y-24 mt-10 md:mt-0\"><div><span class=\"font-display text-lg md:text-xl italic text-[#D4A574] block mb-4\">01. Auditoría de Flujo</span><p class=\"font-body text-[#0A2540]/70 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Analizamos la carga operativa actual de su clínica para determinar qué procedimientos láser impactarán más su facturación mensual.</p></div><div><span class=\"font-display text-lg md:text-xl italic text-[#D4A574] block mb-4\">02. Demostración in-situ</span><p class=\"font-body text-[#0A2540]/70 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Llevamos el equipamiento a su consultorio para una prueba clínica real bajo su propia casuística de pacientes.</p></div><div><span class=\"font-display text-lg md:text-xl italic text-[#D4A574] block mb-4\">03. Certificación Clínica</span><p class=\"font-body text-[#0A2540]/70 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Capacitación exhaustiva por especialistas clínicos internacionales para garantizar el dominio total de la tecnología.</p></div><div><span class=\"font-display text-lg md:text-xl italic text-[#D4A574] block mb-4\">04. Soporte Local 24/7</span><p class=\"font-body text-[#0A2540]/70 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Ingeniería técnica basada en Lima con respuesta inmediata para garantizar que su inversión nunca deje de producir.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-[#0A2540] text-white py-32 px-6 md:px-12 relative overflow-hidden mb-40\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-full md:w-1/3 h-full opacity-10\"><img alt=\"Retrato de odontólogo clínico con bata profesional\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover grayscale\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fhome-brand-wiser.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fhome-brand-wiser.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fhome-brand-wiser.webp&amp;w=768&amp;q=75 768w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fhome-brand-wiser.webp&amp;w=1024&amp;q=75 1024w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fhome-brand-wiser.webp&amp;w=1280&amp;q=75 1280w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fhome-brand-wiser.webp&amp;w=1536&amp;q=75 1536w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fstitch%2Fhome-brand-wiser.webp&amp;w=1536&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl relative z-10\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-6xl text-[#D4A574] mb-8\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&#x27;FILL&#x27; 1\">format_quote</span><blockquote class=\"font-display text-[3.5vw] leading-tight editorial-spacing mb-12\">“La integración láser transformó nuestra percepción de la cirugía periodontal. No es solo tecnología, es la confianza de saber que el post-operatorio de mis pacientes es ahora predecible.”</blockquote><cite class=\"not-italic\"><span class=\"font-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D4A574] block mb-1\">Dr. Alejandro Vargas</span><span class=\"font-body text-sm opacity-50 uppercase tracking-wider\">Especialista en Rehabilitación Oral, Lima</span></cite></div></section><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 mb-40\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 gap-0 items-start\"><div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-4 mb-10 md:mb-0\"><span class=\"font-display text-7xl font-light italic text-[#D4A574]/20 block mb-4\">03</span><h3 class=\"font-label text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#0A2540]\">Retorno de Inversión</h3></div><div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-12 text-center\"><div class=\"py-12 border-r border-[#0A2540]/5\"><span class=\"font-display text-5xl md:text-8xl font-light text-[#0A2540] block mb-4\">+37%</span><p class=\"font-label text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#0A2540]/60\">Incremento en Facturación Quirúrgica</p></div><div class=\"py-